{c: Verse 1}
[G] [Am]
[Am] Kyun lamhe kha [Em] rab karein
[G]Aa ghalti behi [D]sab karein,        [Am]Do pal ki jo [Em]neend udi
Aa [G]poore saare [D]khaab karein,        Kya [Am]karne hai umron ke [C]waade
Ye jo [Em]rehte hain rehne de [D]aadhe,        Do [Am]baar nahi ik [Em]baar sahi
Ik [G]raat ki kar le tu [D]yaari,        Subah tak [Am]maan ke meri [C]baat
Tu aise [G]zor se naachi [D]aaj,        Ki ghungroo [Am]toot gaye [Em]
Ki ghungroo [Am]toot gaye,        Chhod ke [Am]saare sharm aur laaj
Main aise [Em]zor se naachi [D]aaj,        Ki ghungroo [Am]toot gaye [Em]
